Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 17:10:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] perf(kv-cache): skip redundant YuanRong exists

Rely on YuanRong MSetD2H to filter existing keys before device copies and use ExistenceOpt.NX for atomic publish semantics. Keep connector-side filtering when KV events need the exact newly stored key set.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
